application "Mobile Tasks" is mobile

model Task
field title is text required
that is all

controller Tasks
action initialize
set status to "Ready on mobile"
set live_preview to "Start typing a task"
set details_preview to "No details yet"
set urgency_preview to "Urgent:false"
set lifecycle_status to "Application started"
set gesture_status to "No gesture yet"
set heartbeat to 0
collect every Task title as task_titles
that is all

action "add task"
create a Task using the current values as task_id
collect every Task title as task_titles
set status to "Added: " plus title
that is all

action "show completed"
open view "completed"
that is all

action "show home"
open view "home"
that is all

when application starts
run action initialize
show view "home"
that is all

when input title changes
set live_preview to "Typing:" joined with title
that is all

when input title is submitted
run action "add task"
that is all

when input details changes
set details_preview to "Details:" joined with details
that is all

when input urgent changes
set urgency_preview to "Urgent:" joined with urgent
that is all

when application pauses
set lifecycle_status to "Application paused"
that is all

when application resumes
set lifecycle_status to "Application resumed"
that is all

when window gains focus
set lifecycle_status to "Window focused"
that is all

when window loses focus
set lifecycle_status to "Window unfocused"
that is all

when someone swipes left
set gesture_status to "Swiped left"
that is all

when someone swipes right
set gesture_status to "Swiped right"
that is all

when someone swipes up
set gesture_status to "Swiped up"
that is all

when someone swipes down
set gesture_status to "Swiped down"
that is all

when someone taps
set gesture_status to "Tapped"
that is all

when someone presses and holds
set gesture_status to "Pressed and held"
that is all

every 1 second
set heartbeat to heartbeat plus 1
that is all
that is all

view "home"
heading "My mobile tasks"
text "The same English MVC code drives this phone-sized preview."
input "Task title" as title
textarea "Task details" as details
checkbox "Urgent" as urgent
show live_preview
show details_preview
show urgency_preview
show lifecycle_status
show gesture_status
button "Add task" runs action "add task"
button "Completed tasks" runs action "show completed"
show status
for each task_title in task_titles show
show task_title
that is all
that is all


view "completed"
heading "Completed tasks"
text "This is a second native mobile view."
button "Back" runs action "show home"
that is all
